2. What states does a thread go through in this code?
Thread t = new Thread(() -> {
    try { Thread.sleep(1000); }
    catch (InterruptedException e) { Thread.currentThread().interrupt(); }
});
// State A: what is the state here?
t.start();
// State B: (immediately after start)
Thread.sleep(500);
// State C: (after 500ms, while t is sleeping)
t.join();
// State D: (after join returns)

